---
import Demo from './Demo';
interface Props { lang?: 'zh' | 'en' }
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
const home = en ? '/en/' : '/';
const rows = en ? [
  ['Mobile browser + typing / copy and paste', 'You already have the text or can dictate into an editor.', 'Select the destination, move the text and review it.'],
  ['Standalone recording / transcription tool', 'You mainly need a recording and its transcript.', 'Check storage, then choose a later organizing tool if needed.'],
  ['Yihu + your Agent web workspace', 'You want to continue existing workspace tasks by voice on iPhone.', 'Prepare the app/models, speak, review the draft and decide when to send.'],
] : [
  ['手机浏览器 + 手动输入/复制粘贴', '已有文字，或系统听写已能满足输入需求。', '选好目的地，带入文字再检查。'],
  ['独立录音/转录工具', '主要想保存录音并得到文字。', '了解存储方式，需要整理时再选后续工具。'],
  ['一呼 + 你自己的 Agent 网页工作台', '想在 iPhone 上用语音接续已有工作台任务。', '准备 App 与模型，口述、检查草稿，再决定发送。'],
];
---
<article class="document voice-guide task-document">
  <nav aria-label={en ? 'Guide context' : '指南归属'}><a href={`${home}#scenarios`}>{en ? 'All scenarios' : '场景指南'}</a></nav>
  <h1>{en ? 'Voice drafts on iPhone, ready for your web workspace' : 'iPhone 语音 AI 草稿，把想法接到网页工作台'}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{en ? 'Speak the next step while it is fresh. Yihu transcribes on your phone and can place text in a compatible workspace draft. Review it, then decide when to send.' : '想法出现时，先说下来。一呼在手机转写，并可把文字填入兼容的工作台草稿。检查后，再由你决定什么时候发送。'}</p>
  <Demo client:visible lang={lang} />
  <h2 id="first-answer">{en ? 'Less app switching, one clear next step' : '少切一次应用，把下一步说清楚'}</h2>
  <p>{en ? 'For example: after reading project material, dictate a question or a reply outline instead of switching through notes and clipboard steps. Keep the wording editable in your own workspace.' : '例如：看完项目资料，口述一个追问或回复提纲，不必先切到笔记再来回复制。文字留作你自己工作台里可检查的草稿。'}</p>
  <h2 id="compare">{en ? 'Voice-first workspace vs mobile-browser copy and paste' : '语音工作台，还是手机浏览器手动复制粘贴？'}</h2>
  <div role="region" aria-label={en ? 'Choose an input workflow' : '选择输入工作流'} tabindex="0">
    <table><thead><tr>{(en ? ['Approach', 'A good fit when', 'Your next step'] : ['方式', '适合什么任务', '你接着做什么']).map(x => <th scope="col">{x}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{rows.map(r => <tr><th scope="row">{r[0]}</th><td>{r[1]}</td><td>{r[2]}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table>
  </div>
  <p>{en ? 'If keyboard Dictation in your current browser already works, it may be the shortest path. Yihu fits people who already have an Agent web workspace and want local speech models, voice notes and selected sharing around it.' : '如果当前浏览器里的系统听写已经够用，可以先用最短的路径。一呼更适合已有 Agent 网页工作台，希望在周围加上端侧语音、录音笔记和自主分享的人。'}</p>
  <h2>{en ? 'Try a small, reviewable task first' : '先从一件能核对的小事开始'}</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>{en ? 'Open your trusted workspace and choose a suitable draft.' : '打开你信任的工作台，选好合适的草稿位置。'}</li>
    <li>{en ? 'Say a question or short reply outline, then stop capture.' : '说一个追问或简短回复提纲，再结束录音。'}</li>
    <li>{en ? 'Review text and destination. Yihu does not press Send; the page may save or sync a draft.' : '核对文字与目的地。一呼不会按下发送，网页仍可能保存或同步草稿。'}</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>{en ? 'What to prepare' : '使用前准备什么'}</h2>
  <p>{en ? 'The current release is source code: iOS 18+, a Mac with Xcode/XcodeGen, your own signing, a trusted HTTPS workspace and separately downloaded speech models. Setup instructions explain the supported paths.' : '当前提供源码：需要 iOS 18+、Mac 与 Xcode/XcodeGen、自有签名、可信 HTTPS 工作台及另行下载的语音模型。接入指南列出了可用路径。'}</p>
  <h2>FAQ</h2>
  <h3 id="faq-assistant">{en ? 'Is it a general-purpose phone assistant?' : '它是能控制所有手机应用的语音助手吗？'}</h3>
  <p>{en ? 'Yihu focuses on your web workspace. It does not replace Siri or supply an Agent backend; the connected service provides its own capabilities.' : '一呼聚焦你自己的网页工作台，不替代 Siri，也不提供 Agent 后端；所连接服务提供各自能力。'}</p>
  <h3 id="faq-editor">{en ? 'Will any web editor work?' : '任何网页输入框都能用吗？'}</h3>
  <p>{en ? 'Use a compatible draft and check the result. If a page cannot accept text, keep it and choose an explicit copying path rather than forcing another input.' : '使用兼容草稿并查看结果。页面无法接纳文字时，保留录文，再选择明确的复制方式。'}</p>
  <h3 id="faq-background">{en ? 'Can it listen continuously in the background?' : '可以一直在后台听我说话吗？'}</h3>
  <p>{en ? 'Capture is a foreground interaction with microphone permission. Start and stop deliberately, and park before operating vehicle controls.' : '录音在前台并需麦克风权限，按需开始和结束；车载操作请先停车。'}</p>
  <h3 id="faq-install">{en ? 'Where is the download?' : '在哪里下载？'}</h3>
  <p>{en ? 'Follow the source-build setup guide. There is no App Store binary linked here.' : '目前按源码构建指南安装，这里没有可直接下载的 App Store 成品。'}</p>
  <p><a href={`${home}start/`}>{en ? 'See setup requirements' : '查看接入条件'}</a> · <a href={`${home}guides/recording-notes-handoff/#compare`}>{en ? 'Compare note workflows' : '录音笔记工作流选型'}</a> · <a href={`${home}guides/bluetooth-audio-input-troubleshooting/`}>{en ? 'Check audio input' : '检查音频输入'}</a> · <a href={`${home}privacy/`}>{en ? 'Privacy' : '隐私'}</a></p>
  <details><summary>{en ? 'Implementation and platform references' : '实现与平台参考'}</summary><p><a href="https://github.com/alexlee2046/yihu-ios/blob/a59676a72c1931bb36dc29ef0810b5e6dc9339ea/README.md">Yihu source release</a> · <a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/iphone/dictate-text-iph2c0651d2/ios">Apple Dictation</a></p></details>
</article>
<style>
  table { width:100%; min-width:600px; border-collapse:collapse; text-align:start; }
  th,td { padding:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:top; }
  [role='region'] { overflow-x:auto; margin-block:24px; }
  .voice-guide > nav { margin-bottom:24px; font-size:14px; }
</style>
